{"mode":"words","text":"Od tego momentu wszystko zależy od twojego celu nauki. Jeśli chcesz tylko rozumieć język, to już osiągnąłeś cel — po prostu pozostań przy krokach drugim i trzecim. Jeśli chcesz mówić, czas na mówienie chóralne: wybierz krótkie zdanie do powtórzenia metodą A-B, ustaw bardzo wolne tempo i mów jednocześnie z nagraniem — jak w chórze. Od razu usłyszysz, jeśli coś brzmi inaczej, i sam się poprawisz. Można to robić wszędzie, nawet w tramwaju: w słuchawkach brzmi to jak rozmowa telefoniczna. A jeśli chcesz nauczyć się pisać, po prostu przepisuj tekst zdanie po zdaniu.","words":[{"s":0,"e":197},{"s":290,"e":557},{"s":615,"e":1358},{"s":1765,"e":2403},{"s":2461,"e":2902},{"s":2961,"e":3100},{"s":3158,"e":3808},{"s":3878,"e":4296},{"s":4365,"e":5259},{"s":6014,"e":6351},{"s":6374,"e":6745},{"s":6803,"e":7198},{"s":7245,"e":7779},{"s":7941,"e":8800},{"s":9276,"e":9416},{"s":9520,"e":9868},{"s":10031,"e":10879},{"s":11006,"e":11331},{"s":11517,"e":11610},{"s":12156,"e":12249},{"s":12307,"e":12643},{"s":12713,"e":13328},{"s":13386,"e":13607},{"s":13653,"e":14257},{"s":14907,"e":15418},{"s":15511,"e":15546},{"s":15604,"e":16440},{"s":17636,"e":17961},{"s":17984,"e":18297},{"s":18390,"e":19423},{"s":20074,"e":20341},{"s":20468,"e":20538},{"s":20584,"e":21049},{"s":21084,"e":22129},{"s":22999,"e":23464},{"s":23533,"e":23963},{"s":24021,"e":24555},{"s":24613,"e":24683},{"s":24741,"e":25484},{"s":25530,"e":26064},{"s":26250,"e":27016},{"s":27667,"e":28189},{"s":28259,"e":28595},{"s":28642,"e":29002},{"s":29071,"e":29721},{"s":30267,"e":30406},{"s":30476,"e":30743},{"s":30848,"e":31567},{"s":31614,"e":31637},{"s":31707,"e":32415},{"s":32601,"e":32821},{"s":33297,"e":33495},{"s":33588,"e":33634},{"s":33657,"e":34319},{"s":35341,"e":35538},{"s":35631,"e":35968},{"s":36026,"e":37117},{"s":37384,"e":37698},{"s":37756,"e":37976},{"s":38046,"e":38336},{"s":38406,"e":39323},{"s":39729,"e":39822},{"s":39927,"e":40147},{"s":40217,"e":40298},{"s":40368,"e":41459},{"s":42